## Minimal Tor config for running Darkdump locally (no systemd required).
##
## Starts:
##   - SOCKS proxy on 127.0.0.1:9050
##   - ControlPort on 127.0.0.1:9051 (cookie auth)
##
## Run:
##   tor -f ./torrc.darkdump
##

SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051

CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFileGroupReadable 1

DataDirectory /tmp/tor-darkdump
Log notice stdout

